<title>JAPAN: Ashimori - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Ashimori - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 11.13		vs	   11.63</p>
<p> Operating	  351    million	  vs	  359    million</p>
<p> Current	    495    million	  vs	  474    million</p>
<p> Net		  227    million	  vs	  200    million</p>
<p> EPS		    3.76 yen	  vs	    3.31 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     61 million	  vs	  61 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Ashimori Industry Co Ltd is a manufacturer of fire hoses.</p>
